==Battleground==
*2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 98% HP:
**10 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 97% HP:
**1 [[I.M. Phace]] spawns.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 22.33 seconds<sup>670f</sup>.
**2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**5 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 96% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10.67 seconds<sup>200f~320f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 7.33 seconds<sup>220f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.
**2 [[Chickful A]]s spawn, delay 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the [[Owlbrow]]s for cash, but keep a low damage unit on the field to chip the base, which will only bring out [[J.K. Bun Bun]], instead of both J.K. Bun Bun and [[I.M. Phace]]. It is way easier to deal with this stage this way. You only need some specialists (mainly [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]]).

